  m_Text: Your party takes a break at a small stream. One of your companions takes
    off their shoes and dips their feet in the water. Suddenly, your companion lets
    out a yelp. Looking at their feet, you see a leech attached to your companions
    foot, sucking their blood. Your companion quickly pull it off, but the wound
    is already bleeding.
